  "job_B1.8.5_20251001_193302": {
    "text": "\u00c6lfric abbod gret Sigefyr\u00f0 freondlice.\nMe is ges\u00e6d, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu s\u00e6dest be me, \u00fe\u00e6t ic o\u00f0er t\u00e6hte on Engliscum gewritum, o\u00f0er eower ancor \u00e6t ham\nNu secge ic \u00fee, leof man, \u00fe\u00e6t me is la\u00f0 to t\u00e6lenne agenne godes freond, gyf he godes riht drif\u00f0, ac we\nUre H\u00e6lend Crist cydde, \u00fe\u00e6t he lufode \u00fea cl\u00e6nnysse on his \u00feeowum swutelice, \u00fea \u00fea he m\u00e6denmann\nAnd he sylf leofode buton eallum synnum on \u00fe\u00e6re ylcan cl\u00e6nnysse, \u00fee he com to mannum, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he\nIohannes eac, se fulluhtere, \u00fee Crist gefullode, heold \u00fea cl\u00e6nnysse gecwemlice gode on mode and on\nAnd he is m\u00e6g\u00f0hades man, for\u00f0am \u00fee m\u00e6g\u00f0had is ge on w\u00e6pmannum, ge on wimmannum, swa swa\nIohannes se godspellere, \u00fee gode w\u00e6s gecweme, and Crist hine lufode for \u00fe\u00e6re cl\u00e6nnysse, swa swa we\nHe w\u00e6s on cl\u00e6num m\u00e6g\u00f0hade gecoren fram gode, and he on m\u00e6g\u00f0hade on ecnysse \u00feurhwunode.\nSume \u00fea apostolas, \u00fee si\u00f0odon mid Criste on his lareowdome, \u00fea \u00fea he her on life w\u00e6s, h\u00e6fdon him\nAc hi sona geswicon \u00fe\u00e6s sinscipes \u00e6fre, sy\u00f0\u00f0an hi Cristes lare geleornodon \u00e6t him, swa swa Petrus\nQuid ergo erit nobis?\nWe forleton ealle \u00feing and \u00fee, leof, folgia\u00f0.\nHw\u00e6t gewyr\u00f0 be us?\nAnd him andwyrde Crist: Ge, \u00fee folgia\u00f0 me, for \u00fei ge sceolon sittan on twelf domsetlum, and ge deman\nAnd \u00e6lc \u00fe\u00e6ra, \u00fee forl\u00e6t on \u00feisum life nu f\u00e6der o\u00f0\u00f0e modor, gebro\u00f0ru o\u00f0\u00f0e geswustru, his wif o\u00f0\u00f0e\n\u00d0ysne wur\u00f0mynt geearnia\u00f0 \u00e6t \u00feam \u00e6lmihtigan gode \u00fea \u00fee mid cl\u00e6nnysse him gecwema\u00f0 on life and\nUnder Moyses lage men moston lybban on maran softnysse and on gesw\u00e6sum lustum, swi\u00feor \u00feonne nu\nLex et prophetae usque ad Iohannem.\nSeo ealde \u00e6 wunode and witegan eac swylce o\u00fe Iohannes timan, and witodlice sy\u00fe\u00fean man sceal mid\nIacob, se heahf\u00e6der, h\u00e6fde twa geswustru buta him to wife be \u00feam ealdan gewunan.\nAc \u00fe\u00e6t is nu manfullic \u00e6nigum menn to donne on \u00feam cristendome, \u00fee Crist sylf astealde on \u00fe\u00e6s\nSe bisceop \u00fea moste under Moyses \u00e6 habban wif and cild for \u00fe\u00e6re gesetnysse, \u00fee nan mann ne moste\nHit mihte \u00fea swa wel beon, for\u00feam \u00fee hi ne m\u00e6ssodon n\u00e6fre, ne husel ne halgodon, \u00e6r\u00fean \u00fee se\nHe ne gecyst nu be nanum cynrene, ac of \u00e6lcere m\u00e6g\u00f0e be \u00fe\u00e6s mannes ge\u00feing\u00f0um, to his halgum\nHe cw\u00e6\u00f0 on his godspelle be \u00feam \u00fee him \u00feenia\u00f0: Sint lumbi vestri procincti et lucernae ardentes in\nBeon eowre lendena ymbgyrde, and beon leohfatu on eowrum handum byrnende.\nLareowas us secga\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t on \u00feam lendenum is \u00fe\u00e6s lichaman galnyss, and god bebead for \u00fei, \u00fe\u00e6t we\nAnd we sceolon habban on urum handum leohtfatu, \u00fe\u00e6t synd \u00fea godan weorc, \u00fee gode licia\u00f0, o\u00f0rum\nEft cw\u00e6\u00f0 se h\u00e6lend to his gingrum \u00feuss: Qui mihi ministrat, me seguatur, et cetera: Se \u00f0e me sylfum\nSe \u00fee Criste \u00feena\u00f0, he sceal him eac folgian \u00e6fre on cl\u00e6num \u00feeawum be Cristes gebysnungum, \u00fe\u00e6t\nIohannes, se godspellere, on his gastlican gesih\u00f0e, Apocalipsis gehaten, \u00fee se h\u00e6lend him onwreah,\nHi sunt, qui cum mulieribus non sunt coinquinati. Virgines enim sunt. Hi sequuntur agnum,\n\u00d0as halgan n\u00e6ron n\u00e6fre mid wifum besmitene.\nHi sindon m\u00e6g\u00f0hade gehealdenre cl\u00e6nnysse.\nHi folgia\u00f0 Criste, swa hwider swa he g\u00e6\u00f0.\nAc \u00fea godes \u00feeowas, \u00fee gode sceolon \u00feenian, gyf hi licga\u00f0 nu on heora lustum her, \u00feonne ne magon\nIs nu for \u00f0i mycel neod l\u00e6wedum mannum, \u00fe\u00e6t hi leornion heora geleafan \u00e6t Cristes lareowum, and\n\u00de\u00e6ra is \u00e6rest riht sinscipe and sy\u00fe\u00fean wudewanhad and \u00feonne m\u00e6g\u00f0had mid \u00fe\u00e6s modes cl\u00e6nnysse.\nRiht sinscipe is on gesinhiwum, \u00fea \u00fee beo\u00f0 ge\u00e6wnode \u00e6fter godes gesetnysse and \u00e6wbryce ne\nHit w\u00e6re swy\u00fee rihtlic \u00e6fter rihtum life, \u00fe\u00e6t se cniht heolde hine sylfne cl\u00e6ne, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he wifode, swa\nAnd \u00e6fter godes gesetnysse eall swa scyldig by\u00f0 geteald se forlegena cniht swa \u00fe\u00e6t forlegene m\u00e6den.\nWudewanhad is, \u00fe\u00e6t man wunige on cl\u00e6nnysse for godes lufon, swa swa \u00fe\u00e6t godspell seg\u00f0, \u00e6fter his\nHit by\u00f0 swy\u00fee sceandlic, \u00fe\u00e6t eald wif sceole ceorles brucan, \u00feonne heo forwerod by\u00f0 and teames\nM\u00e6g\u00f0had is witodlice se \u00fee wuna\u00f0 on cl\u00e6nnysse \u00e6fre fram cildhade ges\u00e6lig for Criste, ge w\u00e6pmenn,\n\u00d0as \u00fery hadas habba\u00f0 \u00feone \u00feryfealdan w\u00e6stm \u00fe\u00e6re godre eor\u00f0an; swa swa \u00fe\u00e6t godspell us seg\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t\n\u00d0a \u00fee on sinscipe wunia\u00f0 mid gesceadwisnysse and heora \u00e6we healda\u00f0 buton \u00e6wbryce symle, \u00fea\n\u00d0a \u00fee on wudewanhade wunia\u00f0 for Criste, \u00fea habba\u00f0 eft \u00e6t him syxtigfealde mede, and \u00fea \u00fee on\nOn \u00fe\u00e6re gesetnysse m\u00e6g sceawian se \u00fee wyle, hu holdlice god spr\u00e6c \u00feurh \u00feone halgan witegan be his\nWe ne magon nu secgan on \u00feysum sceortum gewrite, hu \u00fea halgan apostolas heredon \u00fea cl\u00e6nnysse,\nAnd se \u00fee him wi\u00f0cwy\u00f0 and heora gesetnyssum, he ne by\u00f0 na wita, ac witodlice gedwola.\nWe r\u00e6da\u00f0 on bocum, \u00fe\u00e6t ungerim bisceopa and muneca w\u00e6ron, swa swa w\u00e6s Martinus, Gregorius\nAnd heora nan ne sealde swylce leafe n\u00e6fre, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6nig weofodes \u00feen moste wif habban, se \u00fee mid his\nEac swylce m\u00e6ssepreostas manega w\u00e6ron halige, swa swa w\u00e6s Beda, se m\u00e6ra bocere, and eft\nOn westenum wunedon \u00fea wisan f\u00e6deras Antonius and Paulus, Hilarion and Macharius, Iohannes and\nAnd swa by\u00f0 \u00e6fre o\u00f0 \u00feissere worulde geendunge, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea cl\u00e6nheortan on Cristes lufe \u00feeonde beo\u00f0 on\n\u00deam sy a wuldor to worulde.\nAmen.",
